{"unit_id":"ElioFanyu__dsh-obsidian#card-zh","repo":"ElioFanyu/dsh-obsidian","commit":"a203966940adfae2740148d44665700b1f8b1d35","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-obsidian 是把本地 Obsidian vault 接入 DSH 的 MCP 插件。它在 DSH 中启动随包提供的 obsidian-mcp 服务端，让模型通过 MCP 工具访问已配置的笔记库，并在 DSH 现有 Web 服务上提供只读健康检查页面。可列出 vault、分页读取笔记、搜索内容或文件名、创建和编辑 Markdown 笔记，也能管理标签。适合希望在 DSH 对话中查找或维护本地 Obsidian 知识库的用户。需要手动配置已初始化且可读写的 vault 绝对路径；不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:28-57","lib/index.js:245-263","server/node_modules/obsidian-mcp/dist/tools/index.js:14-42","server/node_modules/obsidian-mcp/dist/tools/search-vault/index.js:79-105"]}
